      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-07-14_WidnesExaminer_art0085" n="art0085">
        <head>WORD TO THE WISE.</head>
        <p>A WORD TO THE WISE.</p>
        <p>The fickle nature of the climate of this country often glves rise t o a variety of ailments and complaints,which assuming at first the form of only a slight indisposition, if neg!eeed and uoheeded may b?come the germ of serious diseases which will tindernine the constitution, and finally result in a long and lingering illness,and per- haps terminate fatally. The variable temperature and the changeable weather of the last month er so, makes it incumbent on all of us to exercise wise and prudent precautions to counteract the evil effects which the weather may have had upon our health and comfort. Already we frequently hear such c-)mplaints as" No appetite." " Those frequent headaches," " This 1- n- guid feeling," and dozens o!' other expree.sions which all point to the urgent need of a good Tonic. Now tt re are several tonic mixtures offered to the Public, at none which have been so uniformly successful as Gwilyni Evans' Quinine Bitters, The Vegetable Tonic. This preparation is acknowledged to be The Best Remedy of the Age for Nervousnss, Weakness, Chest Affections, Palpitation of the Heart, Indigestion, Liver Complaint, and Influenza.</p>
        <p>The numerous cases of marvellous cures effected, and the restoratinn Co perfect health, of those who had long suffered and had vainly tried other renv,dies, can be accounted for by simply s sting the effect which Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters has upon the System. Ist. It strikes at the source of the disease, and by removing the causes of disease, the evil effects soon Vanish.</p>
        <p>2nd. It strengthens that part of the system which is weakest, and therefore, most liable to the attacks of colds and all diseases.</p>
        <p>3rd: It purifies the blood, and thus gives new life and force to all parse of .the body, for disease cannot exist where there is a free circulation of pure blood. 4th. It gives healthy action to the digestive organs, and to the liver, thus aiding to kelp away Indigestion, and the host of different forms of disease which result rom it.</p>
        <p>sth. By removing impurities,strengthening the weak parts of the system, and purifying the blood, the human frame is well fortified to withstand the attacks of dis- ease. It is repelled, and its place taken by health and strength, through the effective action of Gwilyin Evans' Quinine flittr!rs, The Vegetable Tonic. Sold everywhere in bottles as. 9d. and 4s. 63. each, or will be sent car- riage free for these prices, direct from the Sole Proprie- tors :--Quinine Bitters Manufacturing Company, Limited,Glanelly, South Wales. Beware of Imitations. See that you get the genuine Preparation with the name, "Gwilym Evans" on Label, Stamp, and Bottle, Without which none is genuine.</p>
