      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-07-14_WidnesExaminer_art0115" n="art0115">
        <head>Fig az Lemon</head>
        <p>Fig az Lemon</p>
        <p>The most delicious and wholesome Jam made, and like all other successful pro- ductions, it has many inferior imitators. The public are therefore warned that if they want the genuine article they must insist upon being served with Deakin.'s.</p>
